<title>UK: Citibank sets call, put warrants on Nikkei 225.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call, put warrants on Nikkei 225.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA said it has issued American-style call and put warrants of five million per tranche, on the Nikkei 225 index.</p>
<p>The warrants mature in March 1998 and March 1999, with a payment date of January 31, 1997. They are all listed on the Frankfurt and Dueseldorf exchanges and the minimum exercise lot is 100.</p>
<p>Calculations are based on a spot reference of 17,400 Yen and an exchange rate of 1.3776 marks per 100 Yen.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
